        {
          "question": "What is predation?",
          "answer": "Predation is an interaction where one organism (the predator) hunts, captures, and feeds on another organism (the prey), resulting in energy transfer between trophic levels"
        },
        
        {
          "question": "What is the carbon cycle?",
